<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vivid Tech cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vivid Tech cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Jeff Kessler downgraded Vivid Technologies Inc to outperform from buy on price.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;stock needs a rest after doubling from its recent IPO (initial public offering) price.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said remains &quot;very bullish&quot; on both prospects for explosives detection overall...and specifically for Vivid.&quot;</p>
<p>-- company makes automated inspection systems to detect plastique and other explosives in airline baggage.</p>
<p>-- shares fell three to 21-1/2.</p>
</text>
